Comparative Analysis Summary
Area	Response A	Response B
Complexity	Beginner / Intermediate	Advanced / Enterprise
Architecture	Basic modular setup	Layered scalable architecture
Security	Minimal validation	Production-grade protections
Motion Design	Standard animations	Cinematic motion systems
Scalability	Limited	High scalability
Accessibility	Partial support	Strong accessibility patterns
Backend Design	Simple API	Structured API architecture
Database	None	MongoDB integration
Deployment Readiness	Basic	Enterprise-ready
